    {
      "source": "The <a class=\"xref page\" href=\"couchbase/template.html\"><code>CouchbaseTemplate</code> and <code>ReactiveCouchbaseTemplate</code></a> helper classes that provide object mapping between Couchbase collections and POJOs.",
      "translation": "提供在 Couchbase 集合与 POJO 之间进行对象映射的辅助类 <a class=\"xref page\" href=\"couchbase/template.html\"><code>CouchbaseTemplate</code> 和 <code>ReactiveCouchbaseTemplate</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Automatic implementation of <a class=\"xref page\" href=\"repositories.html\">imperative and reactive <code>Repository</code> interfaces</a> including support for <a class=\"xref page\" href=\"repositories/custom-implementations.html\">custom query methods</a>.",
      "translation": "自动实现<a class=\"xref page\" href=\"repositories.html\">命令式和响应式 <code>Repository</code> 接口</a>，包括对<a class=\"xref page\" href=\"repositories/custom-implementations.html\">自定义查询方法</a>的支持。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Spring configuration support with <a class=\"xref page\" href=\"couchbase/configuration.html\">Java-based <code>@Configuration</code> classes</a>.",
      "translation": "支持使用基于 Java 的 `<code>@Configuration</code>` 类进行 Spring 配置，详见<a class=\"xref page\" href=\"couchbase/configuration.html\">此处</a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<a class=\"xref page\" href=\"couchbase/template.html#exception-translation\">Exception translation</a> into Spring’s portable <a href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/reference/7.0/data-access/dao.html#dao-exceptions\">data-access.html#dao-exceptions</a>[Data Access Exception Hierarchy].",
      "translation": "<a class=\"xref page\" href=\"couchbase/template.html#exception-translation\">异常转换</a>到 Spring 的可移植 <a href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/reference/7.0/data-access/dao.html#dao-exceptions\">数据访问异常层次结构</a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Feature rich object mapping integrated with <em>Spring’s</em> <a href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/reference/7.0/core/validation/convert.html\">Conversion Service</a>.",
      "translation": "功能丰富的对象映射，与<em>Spring 的</em><a href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/reference/7.0/core/validation/convert.html\">转换服务</a>集成。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "For most data-oriented tasks, you can use the <code>[Reactive]CouchbaseTemplate</code> or the <code>Repository</code> support, both of which use the rich object-mapping functionality.\nSpring Data Couchbase uses consistent naming conventions on objects in various APIs to those found in the Couchbase Java SDK so that they are familiar and so that you can map your existing knowledge onto the Spring APIs.",
      "translation": "对于大多数面向数据的应用任务，您可以使用 `<code>[Reactive]CouchbaseTemplate</code>` 或 `Repository` 支持，两者均利用了丰富的对象映射功能。Spring Data Couchbase 在各种 API 中的对象命名约定与 Couchbase Java SDK 中的一致，使其易于熟悉，并让您能够将现有的知识映射到 Spring API 上。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Spring Data support for Couchbase contains a wide range of features:",
      "translation": "Couchbase 的 Spring Data 支持包含广泛的功能：",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Annotation-based mapping metadata that is extensible to support other metadata formats.",
      "translation": "支持扩展以适配其他元数据格式的基于注解的映射元数据。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
